# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:18
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_5c55ea21:

    # "... The bells rang that day as panic filled the streets of Novaras."
    "... Os sinos tocaram naquele dia enquanto o pânico tomava as ruas de Novaras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:20
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_1e4510e5:

    # "The sky turned a red crimson as the dark forces of the Demorai marched to the beat of thousands of war drums that could be heard for miles around."
    "O céu tornou-se de um vermelho carmesim enquanto as forças sombrias dos Demorai marchavam ao ritmo de milhares de tambores de guerra que se podiam ouvir por quilômetros ao redor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:21
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_a7ff46eb:

    # "As the Demorai forces slammed against the walls with great catapults and scorched beasts, the Alderian men stationed valiantly fought back."
    "Enquanto as forças Demorai batiam contra as muralhas com grandes catapultas e bestas abrasadoras, os homens alderianos estacionados lutavam valentemente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:22
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_45dae7fc:

    # "The Demorai had yet to breach the walls, yet from the sheer volume of men heading up towards the top of the great walls of Novaras, and from the screams above and sounds of bolts firing and blades clashing, the battle was an intense one."
    "Os Demorai ainda não haviam rompido as muralhas, mas pelo enorme volume de homens subindo ao topo das grandes muralhas de Novaras, e pelos gritos vindos de cima, o som de dardos a disparar e lâminas a chocar, a batalha era intensa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:23
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_6f8f0543:

    # "Every now and then, a loud scream rang out followed by a sharp thud as one of the men high up on the wall fell, coming sharply crashing into the ground and reduced to bloody piles of gore."
    "De vez em quando, um grito alto ecoava seguido por um baque surdo quando um dos homens lá no alto da muralha caía, chocando-se fortemente contra o chão e reduzindo-se a pilhas sangrentas de carne."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:31
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_ae7df25f:

    # GUARD "Captain Nyx has sent me to escort you to her at once!"
    GUARD "O Capitão Nyx enviou-me para escoltá-lo até ela imediatamente!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:33
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_5e36eb7d:

    # MC @ serious "Lead the way."
    MC @ serious "Guie o caminho."

