# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:281
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_17b42080:

    # "The streets were awash with blood."
    "As ruas estavam cobertas de sangue."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:283
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_51a7696d:

    # "The usual laughter and promise of a good time had been replaced only with screams and cries as bodies littered the cobblestone roads."
    "As risadas habituais e a promessa de diversão haviam sido substituídas apenas por gritos e choros enquanto corpos cobriam as ruas de paralelepípedos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:285
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_f7fef1ae:

    # "I watched as one of those things held a dead woman in its arms, the huge bloody gash in her stomach having drained the color completely from her body."
    "Eu observei enquanto uma daquelas coisas segurava uma mulher morta em seus braços, o enorme corte sangrento em seu estômago tendo drenado completamente a cor de seu corpo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:287
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_SiegeStart_63778b94:

    # "Taking a bite, the creature tore away at some of the flesh before looking up towards me and snarling."
    "Dando uma mordida, a criatura arrancou um pedaço da carne antes de olhar para mim e rosnar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:303
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_5c3ef822:

    # "As I readied my claws, my eyes darted up to see a familiar face—Shani, fleeing for her life as one of those things chased her down on all fours!"
    "Enquanto eu preparava minhas garras, meus olhos se voltaram para cima e vi um rosto familiar—Shani, fugindo para salvar sua vida enquanto uma daquelas coisas a perseguia de quatro!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:305
