    # "Just then, before the killing blow could land, a recognizable face appeared, swinging a blade that slashed at the beast with a wild, desperate strike!"
    "Naquele momento, antes que o golpe mortal pudesse atingir, um rosto familiar apareceu, brandindo uma lâmina que golpeou a fera com um ataque selvagem e desesperado!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:324
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_ba5ee957:

    # ALYSHA "G-GET BACK!"
    ALYSHA "V-VÁ PARA TRÁS!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:326
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_85d50317:

    # "Her sudden attack caught the beast off guard, the blade cutting across its face and slashing through one of its eyes."
    "Seu ataque repentino pegou a fera desprevenida, a lâmina cortando seu rosto e rasgando um de seus olhos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:327
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_Siege_ShaniScene_Prepared_64e1e16c:

    # "The creature shrieked in pain, clutching at the bloody wound as it stumbled back."
    "A criatura gritou de dor, agarrando a ferida sangrenta enquanto cambaleava para trás."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:328
