    # "Shani, wide-eyed and terrified, stared up from the ground at the shaking knight before her."
    "Shani, de olhos arregalados e aterrorizada, olhou do chão para o cavaleiro trêmulo diante dela."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:333
