    # "The scene atop the wall was grim—scattered corpses of Alderian soldiers and Demorai invaders lay piled on top of one another."
    "A cena no topo da muralha era sombria — cadáveres espalhados de soldados alderianos e invasores demorai jaziam empilhados uns sobre os outros."

