translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_GotToTheWall_de2902b7:

    # "We raced forward, just in time to see the last few remaining soldiers fall before… {i}him.{/i}"
    "Corremos para a frente, bem a tempo de ver os últimos soldados restantes caírem diante… {i}dele.{/i}"

