    # "Now under the control of the powerful merchant lords, the city had flourished into one of great splendour... And danger."
    "Agora sob o controle dos poderosos senhores mercadores, a cidade florescera em um lugar de grande esplendor... E perigo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3526
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_9a6564ac:

    # "For beneath it's shiny exterior, there were no {i}laws{/i} as such anymore in Hamun,"
    "Pois sob seu exterior brilhante, não havia mais {i}leis{/i} propriamente ditas em Hamun,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3527
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_72f3238d:

    # "Only the many armed guards the various merchant factions paid to maintain their control gave some semblance of peace."
    "Somente os muitos guardas armados que as diversas facções mercantis pagavam para manter seu controle davam alguma aparência de paz."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3531
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_b2cbe1ec:

    # "But beyond the ever looming threat not to to cause unncessary trouble, the city was truly free."
    "Mas além da ameaça sempre iminente de não causar problemas desnecessários, a cidade era verdadeiramente livre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3534
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_7b096b57:

    # GUARD "HALT!"
    GUARD "PARE!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3535
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_30a13115:

    # GUARD "What's your business in the free city?"
    GUARD "Qual é o seu negócio na cidade livre?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3536
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_04843039:

    # MC @ serious "Does it matter?"
    MC @ serious "Isso importa?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3537
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_ad7dd3d2:

    # "The guard looked us up and down before laughing."
    "O guarda nos olhou de cima a baixo antes de rir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3538
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_7454ce35:

    # GUARD "Only if you cause trouble."
    GUARD "Só se causares problemas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3539
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_9786878e:

    # GUARD "You start something, don't be surprised if you find yourself losing your head."
    GUARD "Se começares alguma coisa, não te surpreendas se perderes a cabeça."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3543
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_233a9947:

    # GUARD "Neigh."
    GUARD "Irra."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3544
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_a5c97cc1:

    # GUARD "But no laws doesn't mean no ones in charge."
    GUARD "Mas não haver leis não significa que não esteja ninguém no comando."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3545
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_592f6245:

    # GUARD "Pretty much every business in the city has some kind of security... Fuck around, and you'll find yourself skewed on the pointy end of one of them."
    GUARD "Praticamente todos os negócios da cidade têm algum tipo de segurança... Arma confusão e vais-te ver espetado na ponta afiada de uma delas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3548
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_1b30c97c:

    # GUARD "{i}Lord{/i} Iryiad runs the most powerful clique, the Zizi, they run the security detail around the city and control the docks."
    GUARD "O {i}Senhor{/i} Iryiad comanda a clique mais poderosa, os Zizi, que gerem a segurança por toda a cidade e controlam as docas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3549
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_148038fe:

    # GUARD "But there's also the Quaygon, the Vulmar and an endless sea of smaller gangs who manage the whores, the raza, and the {i}'protection'{/i} of the local businesses."
    GUARD "Mas também há os Quaygon, os Vulmar e um mar interminável de pequenos gangues que tratam das prostitutas, do raza e da {i}'proteção'{/i} dos negócios locais."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3550
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_3712bd09:

    # MC @ think "You seem very forthcoming with all this."
    MC @ think "Pareces muito comunicativo com tudo isto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3551
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_659b07b0:

    # GUARD "Some people come here and think because we've no laws they can just do {i}whatever{/i} they like."
    GUARD "Algumas pessoas vêm cá e pensam que, por não termos leis, podem fazer {i}o que lhes apetece{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3552
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_2750a12b:

    # GUARD "It's best to let them know that would be a poor choice."
    GUARD "É melhor fazê-los saber que seria uma má escolha."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3555
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_d13669b0:

    # GUARD "Do I look like a tour guide?"
    GUARD "Pareço um guia turístico?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3556
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_d3bb6433:

    # GUARD "Fuck off, buy yourself a couple sellswords and have them show you around!"
    GUARD "Vai-te foder, compra uns mercenários e pede-lhes para te mostrarem a cidade!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3560
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_276c314a:

    # GUARD "Go on then, in ya get."
    GUARD "Anda lá, entra."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3568
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_15e2997a:

    # KIARA @ happy "Ahh... Finally! We've made it."
    KIARA @ happy "Ahh... Finalmente! Chegámos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3569
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_310c3340:

    # MC @ talk "What now?"
    MC @ talk "E agora?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3570
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_3a698037:

    # KIARA @ talk "{i}The Pale Dragon.{/i}"
    KIARA @ talk "{i}O Dragão Pálido.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3571
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_6351a36b:

    # KIARA @ talk "It's an inn nearby, we have a room already prepared for us."
    KIARA @ talk "É uma estalagem próxima, já temos um quarto preparado para nós."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3574
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_3dc1a544:

    # MARKUS @ shock "Gods... Look at this place!"
    MARKUS @ shock "Pelos deuses... Olha para este lugar!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3575
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_b702726f:

    # MARKUS @ shock "I had heard rumors about how much the city had changed since it broke away, but-"
    MARKUS @ shock "Tinha ouvido rumores sobre o quanto a cidade tinha mudado desde que se separou, mas-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3576
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_095355cd:

    # MARKUS @ joy "It's certainly an impressive sight."
    MARKUS @ joy "É certamente uma visão impressionante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3582
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_4999deb8:

    # VES @ talk "..."
    VES @ talk "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3584
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_93e74526:

    # MC @ talk "Ves? Are you alright?"
    MC @ talk "Ves? Você está bem?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3585
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_2fda7f15:

    # VES @ talk "Yes... Just-"
    VES @ talk "Sim... Só-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3586
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_a866539e:

    # VES @ blush "It's been a long time since I've been around so many people."
    VES @ blush "Já faz muito tempo que não fico perto de tantas pessoas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3587
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_6eec3fc9:

    # MC @ talk "So, what's your plan now you're here?"
    MC @ talk "Então, qual é o seu plano agora que está aqui?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3591
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_64bb87e3:

    # VES @ talk "I'm looking for someone."
    VES @ talk "Estou procurando alguém."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3592
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_17dd6ac1:

    # VES @ blush "... But, perhaps if you don't mind, I could stay with you and the others for a while."
    VES @ blush "... Mas, talvez, se você não se importar, eu poderia ficar com você e os outros por um tempo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3593
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_6a80da6d:

    # MC @ think "Who are you looking for?"
    MC @ think "Quem você está procurando?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3594
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_1b256352:

    # "Ves opened her mouth to say something, but she paused and smiled awkwardly, changing the subject quickly."
    "Ves abriu a boca para dizer algo, mas fez uma pausa e sorriu sem jeito, mudando de assunto rapidamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3595
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_2c8bbd11:

    # VES @ smile "I'll... tell you about it another time."
    VES @ smile "Eu... te conto sobre isso outra hora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3596
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_f97d9bbc:

    # VES @ talk "Come, I'm tired... Let's find this {i}Pale Dragon.{/i}"
    VES @ talk "Venha, estou cansado... Vamos encontrar este {i}Dragão Pálido.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3610
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_bad11f44:

    # "Smoke rose from every corner of the inn, a mixture of strange, hot aromas like that of sweet, crushed flowers all mixed in."
    "Fumaça subia de cada canto da estalagem, uma mistura de aromas estranhos e quentes como o de flores doces e trituradas, tudo misturado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3611
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_8ac356c7:

    # "With every breath, you could feel a small surge of energy as the whole place seemed embraced by a hazy fog."
    "A cada respiração, você podia sentir uma pequena onda de energia, enquanto todo o lugar parecia abraçado por uma névoa turva."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3612
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_a9959744:

    # "Sat hudled around tables, men, women, {i}other things,{/i} sat smoking from their pipes as the raza choked the air."
    "Sentados amontoados ao redor das mesas, homens, mulheres, {i}outras coisas,{/i} fumavam seus cachimbos enquanto a raza sufocava o ar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3613
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_007901a8:

    # "In and around the place were guards, always watching, already ready for trouble, as the loosely dressed women served drinks."
    "Dentro e ao redor do lugar havia guardas, sempre atentos, já prontos para encrenca, enquanto as mulheres com roupas largas serviam bebidas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3617
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_4e4e3c61:

    # RANIA @ talk "Welcome... Welcome to {i}The Pale dragon,{/i} I am your host, Rania."
    RANIA @ talk "Bem-vindos... Bem-vindos ao {i}Dragão Pálido,{/i} sou sua anfitriã, Rania."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3619
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_456841ec:

    # RANIA @ talk "What pleasures do you and your companions seek?"
    RANIA @ talk "Que prazeres você e seus companheiros procuram?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3620
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_72b4870f:

    # RANIA @ smile "Perhaps some Raza or... {i}companionship?{/i}"
    RANIA @ smile "Talvez um pouco de Raza ou... {i}companhia?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3621
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_e06794ab:

    # "The woman looked towards me and Markus, pulling down her dress slightly to expose a breast as she winked."
    "A mulher olhou para mim e para Markus, puxando levemente o vestido para baixo para expor um seio enquanto piscava."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3622
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_b4652a2d:

    # MC @ lewd "Well-"
    MC @ lewd "Bem-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3623
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_b70528c0:

    # KIARA @ angry "We should be meeting a friend here in one of the rooms upstairs."
    KIARA @ angry "Devemos encontrar um amigo aqui em um dos quartos no andar de cima."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3624
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_0d2e6967:

    # KIARA @ talk "{i}The one with a view so you might see the dragon to the east.{/i}"
    KIARA @ talk "{i}Aquele com vista para que você possa ver o dragão a leste.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3625
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_6b161c8d:

    # "Rania's eyes widened as she smiled."
    "Os olhos de Rania se arregalaram enquanto ela sorria."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3626
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_26dbca39:

    # RANIA @ smile "Ahh... Yes."
    RANIA @ smile "Ahh... Sim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3627
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_18a797f5:

    # RANIA @ smile "Everything is already ready for you, first room on the left upstairs."
    RANIA @ smile "Tudo já está pronto para você, primeiro quarto à esquerda no andar de cima."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3628
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_9856acc2:

    # "Rania's eyes glanced over towards those with me."
    "Os olhos de Rania se voltaram para aqueles que estavam comigo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3629
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_8f3729b3:

    # RANIA @ talk "For your companions, we have some rooms further down the hall."
    RANIA @ talk "Para seus companheiros, temos alguns quartos mais adiante no corredor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3630
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_367b6b8c:

    # RANIA @ smile "We hope you enjoy your stay with us."
    RANIA @ smile "Esperamos que aproveite sua estadia conosco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3640
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_8baba82b:

    # MC @ talk "... Now what?"
    MC @ talk "... E agora?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3641
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_95d5d7eb:

    # KIARA @ talk "Rest. Stay here the night where it's safe, in the morning then, my mistress should join us."
    KIARA @ talk "Descanse. Fique aqui esta noite onde é seguro, de manhã, então, minha senhora deve se juntar a nós."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3642
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_9483b162:

    # MC @ think "You still haven't explained everything like you said you would."
    MC @ think "Você ainda não explicou tudo como disse que faria."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3643
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_384a3513:

    # KIARA @ talk "In time, for now, just rest."
    KIARA @ talk "Com o tempo, por agora, apenas descanse."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3644
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_5303acdd:

    # KIARA @ talk "It's been quite the journey just to get here."
    KIARA @ talk "Foi uma jornada e tanto apenas para chegar aqui."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3645
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_4e981b88:

    # MC @ serious "... Fine."
    MC @ serious "... Tudo bem."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3646
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_5e60fe78:

    # KIARA @ talk "Just call if you need me."
    KIARA @ talk "Apenas chame se precisar de mim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3653
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_6b3d694c:

    # MC "(...Just what am I walking into now?)"
    MC "(...No que estou me metendo agora?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3654
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_GuardMenu_78e5b98a:

    # MC "(I should get some rest.)"
    MC "(Eu deveria descansar um pouco.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3684
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_b2f9b151:

    # "... Swirling around me, an endless black sea cut through by a rift of stars and strange colors."
    "... Girando ao meu redor, um mar negro sem fim cortado por uma fenda de estrelas e cores estranhas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3685
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_f69770e0:

    # "Three bright suns surrounded a great dark circle, radiating a strange power."
    "Três sóis brilhantes cercavam um grande círculo escuro, irradiando um poder estranho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3686
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_df7c51ac:

    # "Stood on some strange rock platform, the two figures, unlike anything I'd ever seen before, turned their gaze towards me."
    "Sobre uma estranha plataforma de pedra, as duas figuras, diferente de tudo que eu já tinha visto antes, voltaram seus olhares para mim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3687
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_dc2b54fd:

    # MC "Where... Where am I?"
    MC "Onde... Onde estou?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3688
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_ff987929:

    # "I looked down, gazing for where my hands, my body, {i}something{/i} should be."
    "Olhei para baixo, procurando onde minhas mãos, meu corpo, {i}algo{/i} deveria estar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3689
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_a4b95f12:

    # "But there was nothing... It was as though I was just two floating, unblinking eyes, unable to move."
    "Mas não havia nada... Era como se eu fosse apenas dois olhos flutuantes, que não piscam, incapazes de me mover."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3696
translate ptPT qst_JudgementDay_PostQuestArrivedToHamun_Dream_545bd3fb:

    # "I spoke... And yet my mouth did not move."
    "Eu falei... E mesmo assim minha boca não se moveu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:3697
